<title>USA: Renal offers 2.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Renal offers 2.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renal Care Group Inc said Tuesday that a registration statement in connection with an offering of 2,500,000 shares of the company's common stock at $32 a  share has been declared effective by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The company said it is offering about 1,064,000 of the shares, and the balance is being offered by certain selling shareholders.</p>
<p>The net proceeds to the company from the offering of about $31.8 million will be used for working capital and general corporate purposes, including future acquisitions and development of additional dialysis centers, a statement from Renal Care Group said.</p>
</text>
